  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Higher Education Partnership for Disaster Resilient Infrastructure (HEP-DRI) Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The HEP-DRI Activity aims to utilize Higher Education Institutions (HEIs) to enhance the systemic resilience of infrastructure against disaster and climate risks. This will be achieved by establishing a network of selected HEIs from the United States and India, working in collaboration with other stakeholders, to address gaps in infrastructure resilience education, training, and knowledge management. The activity aims to strengthen the capacity of stakeholders and foster a higher education ecosystem focused on infrastructure resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
